-# Styles are inline: email clients strip <style> blocks.
%div{ style: "font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2f3640;" }
  %p Hello,

  %p
    Your Pynwheel Partner API key for
    %strong= @partner_label
    is ready. Open the link below to read it.

  %p{ style: "margin: 26px 0;" }
    %a{ href: @reveal_url,
        style: "display: inline-block; padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 5px; background: #2d7ff9; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;" }
      View your API key

  %p{ style: "font-size: 12.5px; color: #6b7280;" }
    If the button does not work, paste this address into your browser:
    %br
    %span{ style: "word-break: break-all;" }= @reveal_url

  %p{ style: "margin-top: 26px; padding: 11px 13px; border-radius: 5px; background: #fff6e5; border: 1px solid #f2dcae; color: #74521a; font-size: 12.5px;" }
    The link opens once and expires in #{@expires_in_hours} hours. Store the key somewhere
    safe as soon as you have it — it cannot be shown again, and a lost key has to be
    replaced by issuing a new one.

  %p
    Thanks,
    %br
    Pynwheel
